{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blood Facsimile</i></strong>\u00a0is a tactical first person shooter set in a dark and surreal sci-fi universe. You play as a contestant being forced to participate in a violent and bizarre television program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.poster.avif?t=1767047541\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.webm?t=1767047541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.mp4?t=1767047541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels can be approached using many different play styles. Choose between lethal and non-lethal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are open ended and interconnected to reward exploring. Multiple routes and creative ways to approach objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gunplay including leaning, weapon sway, high recoil sensitivity, and a variety of weapons such as a stealthy silenced pistol, a high caliber rifle, a silenced shotgun equipped with an x-ray screen and more.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit earlier areas to collect newly accessible items and see changes in the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs and learn about the world they inhabit.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910410?t=1767047541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910410?t=1767047541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/d6fa093a2dd8963c0cc3a358228d97adb0d0ac06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767047541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/d6fa093a2dd8963c0cc3a358228d97adb0d0ac06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767047541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Stylistic and low-res depictions of violence and gore. Contains profanity and reference to drug use."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blood Facsimile</i></strong>\u00a0is a tactical first person shooter set in a dark and surreal sci-fi universe. You play as a contestant being forced to participate in a violent and bizarre television program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.poster.avif?t=1767047541\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.webm?t=1767047541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/c22885f0f8ca06026c2fe07ce06ee143.mp4?t=1767047541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels can be approached using many different play styles. Choose between lethal and non-lethal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are open ended and interconnected to reward exploring. Multiple routes and creative ways to approach objectives.</p></li><li><